6608\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Housemaid\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. From director Paul Feig, the film plunges audiences into a twisted world where perfection is an illusion, and nothing is as it seems. Trying to escape her past, Millie (Sweeney) accepts a job as a live-in housemaid for the wealthy Nina (Seyfried) and Andrew Winchester (Brandon Sklenar). But what begins as a dream job quickly unravels into something far more dangerous \u2014 a sexy, seductive game of secrets, scandal, and power. Behind the Winchesters\u2019 closed doors lies a world of shocking twists that will leave you guessing until the very end.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"THE HOUSEMAID is a wildly entertaining thriller starring Sydney Sweeney and Amanda Seyfried, based on the best-selling book. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, injury detail, sex, sexual violence, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":131,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjThWa5R8Zw\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004322\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004324\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005947\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009337\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009458\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012668\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012669\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012670\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a8844268-054d-43db-9829-a96cd7a752cf\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006608\",\"hoCode\":\"A