          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"businessDate\":\"2026-05-15\",\"showtimes\":[{\"id\":\"VIC1-82937\",\"schedule\":{\"businessDate\":\"2026-05-15\",\"startsAt\":\"2026-05-15T18:00:00+01:00\",\"endsAt\":\"2026-05-15T19:55:00+01:00\",\"filmStartsAt\":\"2026-05-15T18:25:00+01:00\",\"filmEndsAt\":\"2026-05-15T19:55:00+01:00\",\"inSeatItemDelivery\":null},\"isSoldOut\":false,\"seatLayoutId\":\"VIC1-3-9\",\"filmId\":\"HO00006303\",\"siteId\":\"VIC1\",\"screenId\":\"VIC1-3\",\"areaCategories\":[{\"areaCategoryId\":\"VIC1-0000000001\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true}],\"attributeIds\":[],\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"requires3dGlasses\":false,\"eventId\":\"0000000047\",\"restrictions\":[],\"filmAdvanceBookingRuleId\":null}],\"relatedData\":{\"sites\":[{\"id\":\"VIC1\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Victoria\",\"translations\":[]},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.4976,\"longitude\":-0.1368},\"contactDetails\":{\"phoneNumbers\":[],\"email\":\"\",\"address\":{\"line1\":\"58 Victoria Street,\",\"line2\":\"London,\",\"city\":\"SW1E 6QW \"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00006303\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"EXHIBITION ON SCREEN: Frida Kahlo 2026 Encore\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"This highly engaging film takes us on a journey through the life of one of the most prevalent female icons: Frida Kahlo. She was a prolific self-portraitist, using the canvas as a mirror through all stages of her turbulent and, at times, tragic life. Guided with interview, commentary and Frida\u2019s own words, EXHIBITION ON SCREEN uncovers that this, however, was not a life defined by tragedy.\\n\\nFeaturing key exhibitions and interviews with world-renowned Kahlo curators, EXHIBITION ON SCREEN explores the extraordinary symbolism and themes in these personal canvases to seek a deeper understanding of the real Frida Kahlo.\\n\\nUsing cinema to take an up-close and intimate look at her works we examine how great an artist she can be considered. Displaying a treasure trove of colour and a feast of vibrancy on screen, this personal and intimate film offers privileged access to her works and highlights the source of her feverish creativity, her resilience and her unmatched lust for life, men, women, politics and her cultural heritage.\\n\\nWe might think we already know Frida Kahlo \u2013 the image of floral crowns, big brows and folk style clothing have made her a muse to generations \u2013 but what lies beneath the surface of this intensely passionate woman?\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"This highly engaging film takes us on a journey through the life of one of the most prevalent female icons: Frida Kahlo. She was a prolific self-portraitist. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-15\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":90,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000512\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005342\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"5763889e-8508-4983-88dc-2a5a0ee9641e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006303\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007777\",\"eventId\":\"0000000047\",\"distributorName\":\"Seventh Art Productions\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000000512\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Exhibition\",\"familyName\":\"on Screen\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000005342\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Ali\",\"familyName\":\"Ray\",\"middleName\":null}}],\"genres\":[{\"id\":\"0000000006\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Documentary\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":null}],\"censorRatings\":[{\"id\":\"VS00000007\",\"classification\":{\"text\":\"TBC\",\"translations\":[]},\"classificationDescription\":{\"text\":\"TBC - Adults.\",\"translations\":[]},\"ageRestriction\":{\"minimumAge\":0}}],\"attributes\":[],\"screens\":[{\"id\":\"VIC1-3\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Screen 3\",\"translations\":[]}}],\"events\":[{\"id\":\"0000000047\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Exhibition on Screen\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortName\":{\"text\":\"EOS\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":{\"text\":\"Working with top international museums and galleries, Exhibition on Screen create films which offer a cinematic immersion into the world\u2019s best loved art, accompanied by insights from the world\u2019s leading historians and arts critics. Executive Producer & Director Phil Grabsky has been making documentaries for over 30 years and is a multi award-winner. For the past 15 years he and award-winning director David Bickerstaff along with their colleagues have been both a major independent producer of arts films for TV as well as a pioneer (and largest producer) of cultural documentaries for the cinema.\\n\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"schedule\":{\"startDate\":\"2024-04-01\",\"endDate\":\"2099-12-31\"},\"siteIds\":[\"ALD1\",\"BLO1\",\"CAM1\",\"CAN01\",\"KIN1\",\"KNU1\",\"MAY1\",\"OXF1\",\"RIC1\",\"SHE1\",\"VIC1\",\"WIM01\"]}],\"filmAdvanceBookingRules\":[],\"areaCategories\":[{\"id\":\"VIC1-0000000001\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Standard\",\"translations\":[]},\"hopk\":\"0000000000\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"isInSeatItemDeliveryAvailable\":false}]}}",
            "size": 2480
